              "ImageDescription": {
                "value": "A <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Small_office/home_office\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Small office/home office\">home office</a> in 22 West, a luxury <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Condominium\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Condominium\">condominium</a>, located in the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/West_End,_Washington,_D.C.\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:West End, Washington, D.C.\">West End</a> neighborhood of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Washington,_D.C.\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Washington, D.C.\">Washington, D.C.</a>\n<p>The 92-unit, 11-story, condominium was built by <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Real_estate_development\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Real estate development\">real estate developer</a> Anthony Lanier of EastBanc, Inc., to the designs of architectural firm Shalom Baranes Associates.  22 West is the city's first residential building to feature a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zinc\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Zinc\">zinc</a>-and-glass facade.  The $120 million project was completed in 2008.\n</p>\nThe unit features <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Modern_furniture\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Modern furniture\">contemporary furniture</a> by Vastu, an <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Upmarket\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Upmarket\">upscale</a> shop and <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Interior_design\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Interior design\">interior design</a> company located in <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Logan_Circle,_Washington,_D.C.\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Logan Circle, Washington, D.C.\">Logan Circle</a>.",
                "source": "commons-desc-page"
              },
